[I] Cartographic Projections Library

[T] PROJ is a generic coordinate transformation software that transforms
[T] coordinates from one coordinate reference system to another, including
[T] cartographic projections and geodetic transformations. It provides a
[T] library and tools such as proj, cs2cs, cct and projinfo.

[U] https://proj.org/

[A] Gerald Evenden
[A] Frank Warmerdam <warmerdam@pobox.com>
